    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113831" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερσ-εύω</span></b> , intr., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>abide on dry land, live</i> or <i>lie thereon,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				321
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				636
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.982b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be dry land,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνυδρος
				εἶναι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				352a23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>lie waste</i> or <i>barren,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				5.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be left as dry land,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλωτὰ εἶναι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				353a25
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εύει</span>
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>make</i> or <i>leave barren,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				61
			</span></i> (<i>b</i>).<i><span class="en">
				114
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				74.29
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be made, become barren,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.2d
			</span></i>, Epist.Philipp. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				9(2).517.30
			</span></i> (Larissa, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				61
			</span></i>(<i>b</i>).<i><span class="en">
				144
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				202
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1120.31
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>, etc.</div>
